    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a  storm, your boat breaks down, but relax! The quirky inhabitants of Zitifono will help you to repair it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure, swim, sail and discover all the secrets of  the mysterious and colorful islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234820/extras/725acb74ec491d09a150412acbf0a5df.poster.avif?t=1754259651\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234820/extras/725acb74ec491d09a150412acbf0a5df.webm?t=1754259651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234820/extras/725acb74ec491d09a150412acbf0a5df.mp4?t=1754259651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail with your boat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mystical history of these islands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on humorous quests!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to the inhabitants and choose what you say to them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim in the  sea and explore hidden places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry weird statues and activate strange mechanisms! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a cool little train!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open world and find secrets.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro low poly style!</p></li></ul>",
